      "id": "s03",
      "type": "CYCLE_LOOP",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Playwright ships its own expect, and expect is a patient critic. It checks, and if the answer is not true yet, it waits and checks again, for up to five seconds. The instant it becomes true, it passes.",
